Fix command injection in archive (CWE-78)

The archive path concatenated the export name from the request into a tar
command line and ran it with subprocess.run(shell=True), so a name containing
shell metacharacters ran arbitrary commands as the service user. archive now
calls shutil.make_archive with the name as a plain argument: no command
string is built and no shell runs, so no request input reaches a command
interpreter.
